cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Intro to Programming: a six-week Python micro-credential'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications or adapt it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Australian Data and Cyber Institute (ADCI)
abstract: >-
  A six-week, beginner Python micro-credential (6 hours per week
  or less) built from short videos, lesson notes, weekly Concepts
  Bridges and practice tasks. It is designed to support credit
  towards an introductory programming unit.
keywords:
  - Python
  - programming
  - beginner
  - micro-credential
